 "script": [
  {
   "cue": [
    "title"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "小朋友们好！还记得第四集的生日聚会吗？今天，我们来办一场更热闹的生日派对！"
    },
    {
     "en": "a birthday party"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "map",
    "show:invite",
    "focus:invite"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "想让好朋友来参加派对，就要邀请他们："
    },
    {
     "en": "invite"
    },
    {
     "en": "I invite my friends."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:invitation",
    "edge:invite>invitation",
    "focus:invitation"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "写在卡片上的邀请，叫请帖。邀请这个词的后面，加上 a t i o n："
    },
    {
     "en": "invitation"
    },
    {
     "en": "a birthday invitation"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:guest",
    "edge:invite>guest",
    "focus:guest"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "被请来的朋友，就是客人："
    },
    {
     "en": "guest"
    },
    {
     "zh": "来了很多客人：",
     "cue": [
      "plural:guest"
     ]
    },
    {
     "en": "guests"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:please",
    "edge:please>invite",
    "focus:please"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "邀请别人的时候要有礼貌，记得说请："
    },
    {
     "en": "please"
    },
    {
     "en": "Please come to my party!"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:celebrate",
    "focus:celebrate"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "大家聚在一起，开开心心地庆祝："
    },
    {
     "en": "celebrate"
    },
    {
     "en": "Let's celebrate!"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:among",
    "edge:guest>among",
    "edge:celebrate>among",
    "focus:among"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "我站在客人们的中间，和大家一起庆祝。在……之中，英语是"
    },
    {
     "en": "among"
    },
    {
     "en": "I sing among my friends."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:without",
    "edge:without>guest",
    "focus:without"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "要是一个客人都没有，派对就冷清了。没有，英语是"
    },
    {
     "en": "without"
    },
    {
     "zh": "它是由两个小词拼起来的："
    },
    {
     "en": "with"
    },
    {
     "en": "out"
    },
    {
     "en": "without"
    },
    {
     "en": "a party without guests"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:age",
    "edge:celebrate>age",
    "focus:age"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "过一次生日，我们就又长大了一岁。年龄，英语是"
    },
    {
     "en": "age"
    },
    {
     "zh": "问别人几岁了，常常这样说："
    },
    {
     "en": "How old are you?"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:forget",
    "focus:forget"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "哎呀，出门的时候，忘了带礼物！忘记，英语是"
    },
    {
     "en": "forget"
    },
    {
     "en": "Don't forget!"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:remember",
    "edge:forget>remember",
    "focus:remember"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "忘记的反面，是记得、记住："
    },
    {
     "en": "remember"
    },
    {
     "en": "I remember your birthday."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:remind",
    "edge:remember>remind",
    "focus:remind"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "帮别人记住一件事，就是提醒："
    },
    {
     "en": "remind"
    },
    {
     "zh": "它和记得一样，也是 r e 开头的哦。"
    },
    {
     "en": "Please remind me."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:excuse",
    "focus:excuse"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "想请别人让一让，或者要打扰别人的时候，我们会礼貌地说：",
     "cue": [
      "alt:excuse"
     ]
    },
    {
     "en": "Excuse me."
    },
    {
     "zh": "打扰、原谅，英语是"
    },
    {
     "en": "excuse"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "focus:please,excuse"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "请和打扰了，都是有礼貌的好孩子常常说的话："
    },
    {
     "en": "Please.",
     "cue": [
      "focus:please"
     ]
    },
    {
     "en": "Excuse me.",
     "cue": [
      "focus:excuse"
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "focus:forget,remember,remind"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "再来比一比这三个和记忆有关的词："
    },
    {
     "en": "forget",
     "cue": [
      "focus:forget"
     ]
    },
    {
     "en": "remember",
     "cue": [
      "focus:remember"
     ]
    },
    {
     "en": "remind",
     "cue": [
      "focus:remind"
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "focus:none"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "最后，跟着我把今天的单词再读一遍吧！"
    }
